{{!
    @template mod_starrating/mobile_view_activity

    @copyright  2026 Think Modular
    @license    https://www.gnu.org/copyleft/gpl.html GNU GPL v3 or later

    The star rating activity as the Moodle app shows it, with as many stars as
    the scale of the activity is long.

    Rendered on the server and compiled by the app as one of its own templates,
    which is why the stars can carry core-site-plugins-call-ws: tapping one
    calls mod_starrating_set_rating and refreshes the page. No JavaScript is
    shipped to the app.

    The params attribute is an Angular expression built in PHP, which is why it
    is a bound [params] attribute.

    An activity that asks for text feedback gets a field for it inside a named
    form. Every call-ws below names that form, and the directive adds what the
    field holds to the parameters, so a star sends the stars and the text in one
    call. The form is only read, never submitted, and Angular swallows its submit
    event anyway.

    The stored feedback is bound from CONTENT_OTHERDATA rather than written into
    the template: it is user text, and the app compiles this template with
    Angular, which would evaluate anything in it that looks like an expression.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * name string Name of the activity, which is the criterion
    * hasintro bool Whether a description was entered
    * intro string The description
    * canrate bool Whether the user may rate
    * stars array List of on, params and label
    * statustext string The current user rating in words
    * showaverage bool Whether to show the average
    * averagetext string The average in words
    * canclear bool Whether the withdraw button is shown
    * clearparams string Params for the withdraw call
    * cleartext string Visible text of the withdraw button
    * clearlabel string Accessible name of the withdraw button
    * successmessage string Confirmation the app shows after a rating
    * feedbackform bool Whether the activity asks for text feedback
    * formname string Name of the form holding the feedback field
    * feedbackmaxlength int Longest feedback that is stored
    * feedbacklabel string Label of the feedback field
    * cansavefeedback bool Whether the button that saves the feedback alone is shown
    * saveparams string Params for saving the feedback with the current rating
    * savefeedbacklabel string Text of that button

    Example context (json):
    {
        "name": "Teaching quality",
        "hasintro": true,
        "intro": "<p>How well was this taught?</p>",
        "canrate": true,
        "stars": [
            {"on": true, "params": "{cmid: 12, rating: 1}", "label": "Rate Teaching quality with 1 of 5 stars"},
            {"on": true, "params": "{cmid: 12, rating: 2}", "label": "Rate Teaching quality with 2 of 5 stars"},
            {"on": true, "params": "{cmid: 12, rating: 3}", "label": "Rate Teaching quality with 3 of 5 stars"},
            {"on": false, "params": "{cmid: 12, rating: 4}", "label": "Rate Teaching quality with 4 of 5 stars"},
            {"on": false, "params": "{cmid: 12, rating: 5}", "label": "Rate Teaching quality with 5 of 5 stars"}
        ],
        "statustext": "Your rating for Teaching quality: 3 of 5 stars",
        "showaverage": true,
        "averagetext": "Average 3.8 of 5 from 12 ratings",
        "canclear": true,
        "clearparams": "{cmid: 12, rating: 0}",
        "cleartext": "Withdraw",
        "clearlabel": "Withdraw your rating for Teaching quality",
        "successmessage": "Your rating was saved.",
        "feedbackform": true,
        "formname": "starrating-feedback-12",
        "feedbackmaxlength": 255,
        "feedbacklabel": "Your feedback (optional)",
        "cansavefeedback": true,
        "saveparams": "{cmid: 12, rating: 3}",
        "savefeedbacklabel": "Save feedback"
    }
}}
<div class="starrating-app">
    {{#hasintro}}
        <ion-item class="ion-text-wrap">
            <ion-label>
                <core-format-text text="{{intro}}"></core-format-text>
            </ion-label>
        </ion-item>
    {{/hasintro}}
    <ion-item class="ion-text-wrap" lines="none">
        <ion-label>
            <p>{{statustext}}</p>
            {{#showaverage}}<p>{{averagetext}}</p>{{/showaverage}}
        </ion-label>
    </ion-item>
    <ion-item class="ion-text-wrap" lines="none">
        <div class="starrating-widget starrating-widget-app" role="group" aria-label="{{name}}">
            {{#canrate}}
                {{#stars}}
                    <a core-site-plugins-call-ws name="mod_starrating_set_rating"
                        [params]="{{params}}"
                        [preSets]="{getFromCache: 0, saveToCache: 0}"
                        {{#feedbackform}}form="{{formname}}"{{/feedbackform}}
                        refreshOnSuccess="true"
                        successMessage="{{successmessage}}"
                        class="starrating-star {{#on}}starrating-on{{/on}}{{^on}}starrating-off{{/on}}"
                        aria-label="{{label}}">
                        <ion-icon name="{{#on}}fas-star{{/on}}{{^on}}far-star{{/on}}" aria-hidden="true"></ion-icon>
                    </a>
                {{/stars}}
            {{/canrate}}
            {{^canrate}}
                {{#stars}}
                    <span class="starrating-star {{#on}}starrating-on{{/on}}{{^on}}starrating-off{{/on}}">
                        <ion-icon name="{{#on}}fas-star{{/on}}{{^on}}far-star{{/on}}" aria-hidden="true"></ion-icon>
                    </span>
                {{/stars}}
            {{/canrate}}
        </div>
    </ion-item>
    {{#feedbackform}}
        <form name="{{formname}}">
            <ion-item class="ion-text-wrap">
                <ion-textarea name="feedback" [value]="CONTENT_OTHERDATA.feedback.text" rows="3" [autoGrow]="true"
                    maxlength="{{feedbackmaxlength}}" label="{{feedbacklabel}}" labelPlacement="stacked"></ion-textarea>
            </ion-item>
        </form>
        {{#cansavefeedback}}
            <ion-item lines="none">
                <ion-button slot="end" fill="outline" size="small"
                    core-site-plugins-call-ws name="mod_starrating_set_rating"
                    [params]="{{saveparams}}"
                    [preSets]="{getFromCache: 0, saveToCache: 0}"
                    form="{{formname}}"
                    refreshOnSuccess="true"
                    successMessage="{{successmessage}}">{{savefeedbacklabel}}</ion-button>
            </ion-item>
        {{/cansavefeedback}}
    {{/feedbackform}}
    {{#canclear}}
        <ion-item lines="none">
            <ion-button slot="end" fill="clear" size="small"
                core-site-plugins-call-ws name="mod_starrating_set_rating"
                [params]="{{clearparams}}"
                [preSets]="{getFromCache: 0, saveToCache: 0}"
                refreshOnSuccess="true"
                aria-label="{{clearlabel}}">{{cleartext}}</ion-button>
        </ion-item>
    {{/canclear}}
</div>
